  "changelog": "Team QA 1.18.0, QA GUI 2.18.0, QA Code 1.11.2 and the Dragon runtime 1.7.0.\n\nteamqa board publish --to colab now puts the QA board on Doc-Colab as a task board: every case and defect is a card in columns by status, with priority, verdicts, steps, findings and evidence, so the team can use Kanban, table and timeline views, filter and comment on each card. An Overview page under the board shows the release verdict and live numbers and charts that Doc-Colab keeps current. A new revision moves the same cards and keeps their comments.\n",
